                "A 200 response with an error message in the body hides failures from caches, monitors and clients: use proper status codes.",
                "Retrying POST after a timeout can duplicate the action: use an idempotency key.",
                "Proxies and load balancers produce their own 502, 503 and 504 responses: check which layer generated the code before blaming the application.",
